    "updated_at": "2022-03-29T14:10:03Z",
    "body": "In general changing things from not-throwing to throwing is seen as likely to be safe. From rejecting to fulfilling should be symmetric in theory, but in practice I think people have found it a bit more dangerous. Still, this is specifically about `abort()` in an edge case, so I suspect it would be safe.",
